[en.EVENT_WINDIGOS_1]
Hidden Event: The Southern Disturbance

[en.EVENT_WINDIGOS_1_desc]
Hidden Event: The Southern Disturbance

[en.EVENT_WINDIGOS_1_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_WINDIGOS_2]
The Southern Disturbance

[en.EVENT_WINDIGOS_2_desc]
Recently, the meteorological observatory found that the airflow in the south of Equestria has been strengthening, and it seems that a powerful energy is brewing, which may cause an abnormal blizzard. Experts warned that it may have a significant impact on the climate of Equestria.
Although we have not yet been able to determine the specific cause of the southern disturbance, there is a folk speculation that it is related to the recent tension: it is said that whenever Equestria is not harmonious, the power of the Windigo will increase.
Of course, this is just a legend. Please do not believe rumors, do not spread rumors, and maintain normal life and work.

[en.EVENT_WINDIGOS_2_o0]
Continue to fight each other, ponies

[en.EVENT_WINDIGOS_2_o1]
Okay

