[en.EVENT_WINDIGOS_4]
The Northern Disturbance

[en.EVENT_WINDIGOS_4_desc]
A period of time has passed, the disturbance in the south has not only been eliminated, but the griffons have observed that the north has also begun to show signs of disturbance... These energy disturbances are all happening in the area where the Windigo is raging... Could the legend be true? This is a dangerous signal.

[en.EVENT_WINDIGOS_4_o0]
Continue to fight each other, ponies

[en.EVENT_WINDIGOS_4_o1]
Okay

